`benchmark.meta description: Applies Boolean union, subtraction, and intersection effects to eight overlapping rectangles.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: compile-timing,allocator

/graphics/boolean
/graphics/path
/graphics/primitives
/graphics/shapes

. paths [Path]
for index in 0 .. < 8
    paths += rectangle(Rect(index * 3.0, index * 2.0, 60, 60))
. checksum Size = 0
for repeat in 0 .. < 100
    for mode in [BooleanEffectMode.union-effect, BooleanEffectMode.subtract-effect, BooleanEffectMode.intersect-effect]
        for path in BooleanEffect(mode).apply(paths)
            checksum += path.count
-- "bench-result graphics/boolean-effect-chain checksum=$checksum"
